<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</p><h1>Open to proposals.<br>Careful with trust.</h1><p>Nora is developed in Morocco by Morave Technologies. Community members may inspect, fork, modify, and propose changes under the license ultimately selected by the authorized rights holder.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container community-grid">
    <article><span class="card-icon icon-purple">↗</span><h2>Propose a change</h2><p>Open a pull request from your fork. Submissions are reviewed; a proposal does not guarantee acceptance. Only authorized maintainers merge into the official repository or publish official releases.</p><a href="/docs">Read project documentation →</a></article>
    <article><span class="card-icon icon-blue">⌕</span><h2>Report a public issue</h2><p>For general bugs and feature proposals, use the issue tracker for the official repository. Include reproduction steps and relevant environment details, but never post secrets.</p><a href="https://github.com/Yasser-devb/nora/issues" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open GitHub issues <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="card-icon icon-orange">!</span><h2>Report a security concern privately</h2><p>Do not disclose exploitable vulnerabilities in a public issue. Private vulnerability reporting availability should be verified in GitHub repository settings before relying on it; if unavailable, contact an authorized maintainer privately.</p><a href="https://github.com/Yasser-devb/nora/security/advisories/new" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check private reporting <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
</div><div class="container governance-note"><strong>Official does not mean exclusive.</strong><p>Forks can develop independently. The official repository and maintainer-designated releases are the authoritative Nora distribution; no claim is made that forks are prevented by repository governance or a license.</p><a href="/contact">Read contact guidance →</a></div></section>
